    not_duplicate_of: []  # 176b
    pr_ref:  # 176b
    description: "PlazaFlow binary relay wire protocol defines typed messages (JOIN, LEAVE, SDP/ICE, YJS_SYNC, etc.) with send sites in TS and receive handlers in Rust. Structurally identical to gRPC/message-queue linking: match message type names across send/receive. Gap: no generalized message dispatch pattern for custom wire protocols. Existing gRPC and message_queue linkers do topic matching but are framework-specific. Need a YAML-driven message type registry pattern (detect enum variants or string constants in send/receive contexts). Bakeoff repos: microservices-demo (gRPC, validates generalization), dash.js (custom protocol messages), any WebSocket-based protocol repo. Cross-refs: linkers/grpc.py (done), linkers/message_queue.py (done), INV-jamad (Linker DSL Name Resolution — name matching across boundaries)."  # 176b
    fields: {}  # 176b
