  message: "Overlaps with WI-logok (annotation convention, todo_soft). WI-logok proposes @hg:publishes/@hg:subscribes comment annotations as a fallback for custom wire protocols. This item (WI-jisib) proposes automatic detection of typed message dispatch (enum variants, string constants). Both approaches are complementary — auto-detect where possible, annotate where not."  # f6b1
